      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 820,
      "text": "Write-only. No totals, no history, nothing to scroll.\nCapture is the only screen you touch during the day — tap a tile, the open block closes and a new one opens.\nThe 90-minute prompt is the single interruption the app is allowed to make."
    },
    {
      "id": "phone-end",
