      "x": 0,
      "y": -190,
      "w": 1400,
      "text": "SUMMARY — the two screens you actually open. Week is the reconcile strip repeated seven times; Month is where a change becomes visible, because week-to-week is signal and day-to-day is noise.\nGoals & priorities is set-up, not reporting: rank by hand, map categories to goals, and the hours fall out of the mapping."
